  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the yellow noodles according to package instructions",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the dissolved palm sugar, soy sauce, oyster sauce, and sesame oil",
    "In a large skillet or wok, heat the sesame oil over medium-high heat and cook the pork loin until browned",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic to the skillet and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and stir to combine with the pork and sauce",
    "Add the pasta water to the skillet and stir to create a creamy emulsion",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and serve immediately"
